DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T130000
DTSTAMP:20260821T134431Z
UID:sancarlos-1100@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow community members in giving back and making a mean
 ingful impact throughout the city. This event offers the chance to connect
  with local organizations\, learn how to get involved\, and a chance to be
 autify our community through two different park projects.&nbsp\; Whether y
 ou are already registered for a volunteer shift or simply interested in le
 arning more\, we encourage you to stop by the Vista or Highlands Park. Cof
 fee and donuts will be available for registered volunteers. For additional
  information\, please visit www.cityofsancarlos.org/dayofservice.&nbsp\;\n
 \nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/business_detail_
 T10_R101.php\nLast synced: 2026-08-21 06:44 PDT
LOCATION:Vista Park and Highlands Park
URL:https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/business_detail_T10_R101.php
END:VEVENT
